@startuml Sequence Diagram - Update API Credentials

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "APICredentialsView" as APICredView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Admin -> APICredView : 1 Open API credentials page
activate APICredView
APICredView -> APICredView : 2 Display credentials form

Admin -> APICredView : 3 Edit credentials
Admin -> APICredView : 4 Click "Save" button

APICredView -> APICredView : 5 Validate input format

alt [Invalid input]
    APICredView -> APICredView : 6 Error notification
    APICredView -> Admin : 7 Display error notification
else [Valid input]
    APICredView -> ClerkAuth : 8 Send update request
    activate ClerkAuth
    ClerkAuth -> Backend : 9 Update API credentials
    activate Backend
    Backend -> Backend : 10 Store credentials
    Backend -> ClerkAuth : 11 Confirmation
    deactivate Backend
    ClerkAuth -> APICredView : 12 Success notification
    APICredView -> Admin : 13 Display success message
    deactivate ClerkAuth
end

deactivate APICredView

@enduml
